---
import "../styles/privacy.css";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const lastUpdated = "September 2026";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Privacy & Cookie Policy — prodbytes.com</title>
  </head>
  <Layout title="Prodbytes - Privacy & Cookie Policy">
    <body>
      <main class="content">
        <h1>Privacy & Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

        <p>
          Prodbytes ("we," "us," "the site") provides free downloadable graphics. 
          This notice explains what information we collect when you use the site, 
          how cookies are used, and how your data is handled.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
          The only personal information we collect directly is your <strong>email address</strong>, 
          which you provide when downloading a graphic. We do not collect names, payment information, 
          or sensitive personal data.
        </p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Email</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To remember your session via a browser cookie so you don't need to re-enter your email repeatedly.</li>
          <li>To send occasional updates about new graphics using Kit, our email service provider.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Cookies & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies to maintain basic site functionality (such as keeping you logged in for downloads) 
          and for serving personalized or non-personalized advertisements.
        </p>
        <p>
          We also keep an internal, anonymous record of graphic downloads to evaluate site usage and popularity. 
          This download data is anonymous and not linked to your email address.
        </p>

        <h2>Advertising & Third-Party Vendors</h2>
        <p>
          This website displays advertisements served by <strong>Google AdSense</strong> and its third-party 
          vendors or ad networks.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits 
            to this website or other websites on the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on 
            their visit to your sites and/or other sites on the Internet.
          </li>
          <li>
            Cookies from other third-party vendors or ad networks may also be used to serve ads on this site.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Opting Out of Advertising Cookies</h3>
        <p>
          You may opt out of personalized advertising at any time:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Opt out of Google's personalized ads by visiting&nbsp;
            <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/authenticated" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Ads Settings</a>.
          </li>
          <li>
            Opt out of third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting&nbsp;
            <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">www.aboutads.info</a>&nbsp;
            or&nbsp;<a href="https://www.networkadvertising.org/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Network Advertising Initiative</a>.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To learn more about how Google uses data when you use partner sites, visit&nbsp;
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's How Google uses information from sites or apps page</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p>We work with the following trusted third-party providers:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — website hosting, file storage, security, and database management.</li>
          <li><strong>Kit</strong> — email newsletter delivery and mailing list management.</li>
          <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> — ad delivery and monetization.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Your email address is stored securely with Kit solely to deliver updates. We do not sell, rent, 
          or trade your email address with any other third party.
        </p>

        <h2>Unsubscribing</h2>
        <p>
          Every email contains an instant unsubscribe link. Unsubscribing removes you from our email list 
          and does not prevent you from downloading free graphics on the website.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about this policy or your personal data, please contact us at&nbsp;
          <a href="mailto:hello@timdwyer.co">hello@timdwyer.co</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          Any updates to this Privacy & Cookie Policy will be posted here with an updated revision date.
        </p>
      </main>
    </body>
  </Layout>
</html>